  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Egypt: Improving the international competitiveness of the textile and clothing sector (GTEX/MENATEX)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The envisaged impact of the programme is to increase employment and income along the Textile and Clothing (T&amp;C) value chain in Egypt. To achieve this long-term objective, the programme foresees to accomplish, by its completion, two major outcomes. One is related to the institutional infrastructure around the T&amp;C sector, including policy aspects, where required, and is formulated as &#x201c;Enhanced TISI performance and regional collaboration in the T&amp;C sector&#x201d;. Under this outcome enhanced regional collaboration and trade in T&amp;C is also envisaged. The second outcome targets the enterprise level which is formulated as &#x201c;Improved competitiveness of SMEs in the T&amp;C sector&#x201d;.</narrative>
  </description>
